{
  "title": "Crest",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "Crest is an 8-voice",
        "hybrid polysynth",
        "after the Novation",
        "Peak: 3 oscillators,",
        "a multimode filter,",
        "3 envelopes, 4 LFOs,",
        "a 20-slot mod",
        "matrix, an",
        "arpeggiator and 4",
        "effects.",
        "",
        "The first page draws",
        "the filter and amp",
        "envelope. Jog turns",
        "pages; Shift+jog-",
        "click opens the",
        "section picker."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Patches",
      "lines": [
        "11 patches: Init and",
        "10 Crest patches.",
        "",
        "Load your own Peak",
        "banks on the Peak",
        "Banks page (.syx in",
        "UserLibrary/Crest).",
        "",
        "The Patches page",
        "shows the bank and",
        "position. Click to",
        "browse, jog to pick."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Oscillators",
      "lines": [
        "Wave: Sine Tri Saw",
        "Pulse or Wavetable",
        "(17 tables).",
        "",
        "Shape bends the",
        "wave: pulse width,",
        "double saw, tri",
        "slope, sine fold,",
        "wavetable frame.",
        "",
        "Density stacks 3",
        "detuned copies;",
        "DnDet sets their",
        "spread.",
        "",
        "VSync is virtual",
        "sync, up to 16x.",
        "",
        "Coarse +-36 st, Fine",
        "+-100 ct. Fixed",
        "plays one note on",
        "every key."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Osc Modulation",
      "lines": [
        "ShSrc picks Mod Env",
        "1 or LFO 1 to move",
        "the shape; ShMod is",
        "how far.",
        "",
        "PEnv: Mod Env 2 to",
        "pitch, up to 8",
        "octaves.",
        "",
        "PLfo: LFO 2 to pitch",
        "(vibrato)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "FM",
      "lines": [
        "FM page: Osc1>Osc2,",
        "Osc2>Osc3, Osc3>Osc1",
        "and Noise>Osc1 phase",
        "modulation.",
        "",
        "Same pitch gives",
        "bells and growls; FM",
        "never detunes the",
        "carrier.",
        "",
        "O3Fl and NsFl run",
        "Osc 3 or noise into",
        "the cutoff at audio",
        "rate."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Mixer",
      "lines": [
        "Levels for Osc 1-3,",
        "Ring (Osc1 x Osc2)",
        "and Noise. NCol",
        "tilts the noise dark",
        "or bright.",
        "",
        "PreOD drives the",
        "filter input; PstDs",
        "distorts after the",
        "filter."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Filter",
      "lines": [
        "Types: LP24 LP12",
        "BP12 BP6 HP24 HP12.",
        "Res near the top",
        "self-oscillates.",
        "",
        "Env1: Mod Env 1 to",
        "cutoff. AEnv: Amp",
        "Env to cutoff. LFO1,",
        "KeyTk and Vel too.",
        "",
        "FDiv gives each",
        "voice its own cutoff",
        "offset."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Envelopes",
      "lines": [
        "Amp, Mod 1 and Mod",
        "2: attack, hold,",
        "decay, sustain,",
        "release, velocity",
        "(- = softer when",
        "hit harder).",
        "",
        "Rpt repeats attack,",
        "hold and decay",
        "(127 = loop).",
        "",
        "Trig in Mono and",
        "MonoLG: Multi",
        "retriggers, Single",
        "keeps running",
        "legato, Reset starts",
        "from zero.",
        "",
        "Delays: own page."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "LFOs",
      "lines": [
        "LFO 1-2 run per",
        "voice, 3-4 are",
        "shared. Range Low",
        "to 200 Hz, High to",
        "1.6 kHz (capped at",
        "1.24 kHz), or sync.",
        "",
        "Mode: Free, Key",
        "(restart per note),",
        "Common (one phase),",
        "CommonKey (one",
        "phase, restarts).",
        "Rpt: cycles, then",
        "stop (1 = one-shot).",
        "",
        "Fade page: Fade",
        "Time, Fade Mode",
        "(in, out, gate in,",
        "gate out), Delay,",
        "MonoTrig (legato).",
        "Slew smooths it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Mod Matrix",
      "lines": [
        "20 slots: Source 1 x",
        "Source 2 >",
        "Destination, with a",
        "signed depth.",
        "",
        "Pick a slot in the",
        "list, then set Src1",
        "Src2 Dest Depth.",
        "Clear empties it.",
        "",
        "Sources include LFO",
        "1-4 (bipolar or +",
        "unipolar),",
        "envelopes, wheel,",
        "aftertouch, Animate",
        "1-2 and the macros."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Macros & Animate",
      "lines": [
        "8 macros each move",
        "up to 4 destinations",
        "by their own",
        "amounts.",
        "",
        "Animate 1 and 2 are",
        "mod sources you",
        "switch: Hold while",
        "held, Latch toggles.",
        "CC 80 and 81 play",
        "them."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Voice",
      "lines": [
        "Mode: Poly, Poly2",
        "(new voice per",
        "note), Mono, MonoLG",
        "(legato), Mono2.",
        "",
        "Unison up to 8",
        "voices with detune",
        "and stereo spread.",
        "",
        "Glide always or",
        "legato only. Dvrg",
        "and Drift add analog",
        "looseness."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Arpeggiator",
      "lines": [
        "Arp On on the",
        "Perform page. Modes:",
        "Up Down UpDown",
        "UpDown2 Played",
        "Random Chord.",
        "",
        "Rate from 2 bars to",
        "1/32T, Gate, Swing,",
        "up to 6 octaves and",
        "33 rhythms.",
        "",
        "Scale, on Perform:",
        "keeps notes in a",
        "scale. Set follows",
        "the Move set.",
        "",
        "Latch holds the",
        "notes; KSync",
        "restarts on the",
        "first key. Follows",
        "Move's tempo."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Effects",
      "lines": [
        "Distortion first,",
        "then Chorus, Delay",
        "and Reverb in the",
        "Route order (or in",
        "parallel).",
        "",
        "Dry and Wet blend",
        "the chain. Delay",
        "syncs to tempo;",
        "reverb has Room,",
        "Hall and Plate."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Peak Banks",
      "lines": [
        "Your own Novation",
        "Peak banks: copy a",
        ".syx file to",
        "UserLibrary/Crest",
        "(any subfolder",
        "works), then open it",
        "with Peak",
        "Bank on the Peak",
        "Banks page.",
        "",
        "Turn Peak Patch to",
        "load a patch. Crest",
        "sets its level in",
        "the background; it",
        "may jump once.",
        "",
        "The patch is saved",
        "with the set, the",
        "bank is not."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Tips",
      "lines": [
        "Touch a knob to see",
        "its value in real",
        "units on the card.",
        "",
        "Start from a Peak",
        "patch, then lower",
        "Cut and raise Env1",
        "for a quick pluck.",
        "",
        "Turn Animate on in a",
        "patch to hear its",
        "performance move."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
